1
00:00:00,940 --> 00:00:03,390
Gus! Our flight is at ten! Are you ready?

2
00:00:03,613 --> 00:00:06,011
I am ready. I packed my bag.

3
00:00:06,597 --> 00:00:09,062
Why is your bag... moving?

4
00:00:11,787 --> 00:00:15,121
Burgers?! Gus, you packed twenty burgers!

5
00:00:15,131 --> 00:00:17,450
It is my emergency food.

6
00:00:17,721 --> 00:00:20,772
We are going to Spain, not to the moon!

7
00:00:21,060 --> 00:00:23,145
You never know.

8
00:00:23,927 --> 00:00:26,861
Okay. Let's go. Taxi!

9
00:00:30,612 --> 00:00:33,178
Good morning! Can I see your passport, please?

10
00:00:33,558 --> 00:00:35,426
Here you are.

11
00:00:35,765 --> 00:00:38,355
Thank you. And the passport for your friend?

12
00:00:38,728 --> 00:00:39,006
Here.

13
00:00:41,475 --> 00:00:44,165
Sir... this is a photo of an egg.

14
00:00:44,330 --> 00:00:46,811
It was a long time ago.

15
00:00:47,250 --> 00:00:49,590
...Okay. Please put your bag here.

16
00:00:51,011 --> 00:00:52,859
Oh no. Your bag is too

17
00:00:52,776 --> 00:00:55,659
heavy. The limit is twenty-three kilos.

18
00:00:56,542 --> 00:00:58,425
Sorry! My bag is too

19
00:00:58,368 --> 00:01:02,105
heavy... because of HIS burgers.

20
00:01:02,319 --> 00:01:04,416
No problem. I can fix this.

21
00:01:07,670 --> 00:01:09,912
...Twenty-three kilos. Perfect.

22
00:01:10,137 --> 00:01:11,907
You're welcome.

23
00:01:12,313 --> 00:01:13,969
Here are your boarding passes.

24
00:01:13,875 --> 00:01:16,249
Gate twelve. Have a nice flight!

25
00:01:16,681 --> 00:01:18,098
Thank you!

26
00:01:22,478 --> 00:01:24,004
Next! Put your bag and

27
00:01:23,886 --> 00:01:25,524
your phone in the box, please.

28
00:01:25,824 --> 00:01:26,721
Of course.

29
00:01:27,871 --> 00:01:30,347
Please take off your shoes.

30
00:01:30,518 --> 00:01:32,628
I don't have shoes.

31
00:01:34,158 --> 00:01:36,243
...Right. Please walk through.

32
00:01:38,161 --> 00:01:39,799
Stop! Do you have any metal?

33
00:01:40,076 --> 00:01:40,519
No.

34
00:01:42,289 --> 00:01:43,743
Are you sure?

35
00:01:44,111 --> 00:01:46,392
Only my golden tie clip. It

36
00:01:46,282 --> 00:01:47,912
was a gift from my grandma.

37
00:01:48,748 --> 00:01:50,132
Please take it off.

38
00:01:51,542 --> 00:01:53,172
I feel naked.

39
00:01:53,617 --> 00:01:55,257
Gus, everyone is looking!

40
00:01:56,228 --> 00:01:57,478
Our flight is in twenty

41
00:01:57,388 --> 00:01:59,718
minutes! Where is gate twelve?

42
00:01:59,935 --> 00:02:00,591
This way!

43
00:02:03,458 --> 00:02:05,920
Gus. This is the toilet.

44
00:02:06,169 --> 00:02:08,569
I needed it anyway.

45
00:02:09,074 --> 00:02:11,349
Excuse me, where is gate twelve?

46
00:02:12,820 --> 00:02:15,978
Gate twelve? Go straight and turn left.

47
00:02:16,441 --> 00:02:17,917
Doctor Max?!

48
00:02:18,280 --> 00:02:21,123
Hello again! Gus, no burgers on the plane, okay?

49
00:02:21,285 --> 00:02:23,127
...Okay.

50
00:02:23,934 --> 00:02:24,909
Run!

51
00:02:28,002 --> 00:02:31,038
Attention, please. Flight two-oh-seven to Madrid

52
00:02:30,941 --> 00:02:34,398
is delayed. New departure time: twelve o'clock.

53
00:02:34,699 --> 00:02:39,729
Oh no! Our flight is delayed. Two hours!

54
00:02:40,011 --> 00:02:43,397
Two hours... Do they sell burgers here?

55
00:02:43,689 --> 00:02:47,071
No more burgers! You ate three at check-in!

56
00:02:47,299 --> 00:02:49,705
They were emergency burgers.

57
00:02:50,045 --> 00:02:52,225
Let's just sit and wait.

58
00:02:55,815 --> 00:02:59,117
Look, Sofia. Geese. They don't wait two hours.

59
00:03:00,133 --> 00:03:01,483
Lucky geese.

60
00:03:05,742 --> 00:03:08,579
Welcome on board! Oh, hello again!

61
00:03:09,100 --> 00:03:11,063
Hello! Where are our seats?

62
00:03:11,341 --> 00:03:14,016
Row fourteen. Window or aisle seat?

63
00:03:14,513 --> 00:03:16,345
Window! I want to see my family.

64
00:03:16,559 --> 00:03:18,101
Your family?

65
00:03:18,964 --> 00:03:21,055
My cousins fly at this height.

66
00:03:24,145 --> 00:03:25,771
Hi, Uncle Gary!

67
00:03:26,028 --> 00:03:28,065
...Of course you have an Uncle Gary.

68
00:03:29,480 --> 00:03:31,023
Would you like chicken or fish?

69
00:03:31,575 --> 00:03:33,670
Chicken, please.

70
00:03:33,818 --> 00:03:36,059
Do you have burgers?

71
00:03:36,331 --> 00:03:38,134
No burgers, sorry.

72
00:03:38,768 --> 00:03:41,574
Then fish, please. A big one.

73
00:03:45,815 --> 00:03:47,454
Ladies and gentlemen, welcome to

74
00:03:47,384 --> 00:03:49,774
Madrid! Have a nice day!

75
00:03:49,946 --> 00:03:52,363
We are in Spain, Gus!

76
00:03:55,089 --> 00:03:57,492
My emergency food!

77
00:03:59,751 --> 00:04:02,661
Uncle Gary! You ate my emergency food!

78
00:04:03,023 --> 00:04:04,874
It was an emergency.

79
00:04:06,003 --> 00:04:07,773
Welcome to Spain, Gus!

80
00:04:08,589 --> 00:04:10,599
Let's practice! Say it with me!

81
00:04:10,887 --> 00:04:12,397
Can I see your passport?

82
00:04:14,597 --> 00:04:16,187
My bag is too heavy.

83
00:04:18,386 --> 00:04:19,816
Where is gate twelve?

84
00:04:21,992 --> 00:04:23,422
My flight is delayed.

85
00:04:25,599 --> 00:04:27,349
Window or aisle seat?

86
00:04:29,544 --> 00:04:30,734
Have a nice flight!

87
00:04:33,448 --> 00:04:36,745
Quick quiz! What did Gus pack in his bag?

88
00:04:36,833 --> 00:04:40,343
A: Clothes. Or B: Burgers.

89
00:04:44,669 --> 00:04:46,779
B! Twenty burgers!

90
00:04:48,106 --> 00:04:49,478
Where do YOU want to fly?

91
00:04:49,475 --> 00:04:51,718
Write the city in the comments!

92
00:04:52,146 --> 00:04:55,509
Have a nice flight! See you next time! Bye!

93
00:04:55,663 --> 00:04:58,225
Bye bye. I'm flying home with Gary.

